# Implementation Plan: MediKiosk Web & Mobile Revamp & Contract Alignment

Revamp the MediKiosk web and mobile interfaces to adopt the canonical **Light Medical Glassmorphism Design System** (ReliaCare-inspired theme: Cream/Sage canvas, Lime `#A3E635` primary CTA with Deep Forest `#064E3B` text, frosted glass surfaces, Lora display + DM Sans body typography, official MediKiosk mark, and strict no-emoji Material Symbols). Concurrently, resolve backend contract drift in `app/` (Modifications B1–B7) and establish an enforceable, ticketed execution plan with testable checkpoints per phase.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Contract Reconciliation & Scope Decisions:**
> 1. **Backend Compatibility Preserved:** The backend in `app/` will be enhanced with B1–B7 without breaking existing desktop kiosk or doctor dashboard routes.
> 2. **Audio Streaming Optimization (B3):** Audio turns will return both `next_question_audio_url` (direct streaming file) and `next_question_audio_base64` (fallback), preventing mobile stutter on 4G connections.
> 3. **Strict No-Emoji & No-Mock Policy:** All emojis in UI components and screens will be purged in favor of canonical Material Symbols / Lucide SVG icons. All mock fixture fallbacks in shipped code paths will be eliminated.
> 4. **Scope Freeze:** As documented in `DOCS/Mobile Revamp/MediKiosk_Android_Revamp_Roadmap.md`, 3D indoor wayfinding maps and BLE sensor pairing remain de-scoped; navigation is consolidated into high-contrast room direction cards.

